{"parse": {"title": "TMW-05", "pageid": 119358, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TMW-04\" title=\"TMW-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TMW-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/TMW-06\" title=\"TMW-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TMW</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.9B.9B.E4.B8.AA.E5.8D.8A.E6.9C.8B.E5.8F.8B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"四个半朋友\">四个半朋友</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 四个半朋友</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Four and a Half Friends</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>来<span class=\"color-value\"></span>吧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>朋<span class=\"color-value\"></span>友<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>！<span class=\"color-value\"></span>影<span class=\"color-value\"></span>子<span class=\"color-value\"></span>剧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>场<span class=\"color-value\"></span>即<span class=\"color-value\"></span>将<span class=\"color-value\"></span>开<span class=\"color-value\"></span>幕<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>请<span class=\"color-value\"></span>大<span class=\"color-value\"></span>家<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>序<span class=\"color-value\"></span>落<span class=\"color-value\"></span>座<span class=\"color-value\"></span>！<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3110105</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_bg_bangongchexiang\"><img alt=\"3_1_bg_bangongchexiang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png/600px-Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png/900px-Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>列车颠簸在寒冬的风雪中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>调查员看向窗外，脑中依然探究着那个在大雪中被递交出去的徽章。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>她的动作很自然，显然不是第一次。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>再加上她似乎见过基金会的人……看来这位列车长女士身上还隐藏着其他不为人知的秘密，需要更细致的调查。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>调查员从衣兜里掏出怀表，轻轻打开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638118.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638118.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638118.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638118.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638118.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638118.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638118.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638118.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>她们离开也有一段时间了，接下来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抬起头，眼神扫过车厢内部。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>由于列车长的“行政流程”，调查员似乎能够在无人知晓的情况下翻看这儿的每一份载录文档。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从行车时刻表到历年来的驾驶日志，这些文件于她而言，几乎触手可及。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>全都摆在这里，简直像是引诱我去查阅一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>太容易得到的线索往往是陷阱，还是谨慎为好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>调查员摇摇头，甩开心中的念头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>久等了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>列车长推门而入，径直坐向她的座位，而侍候在身旁的则是她忠诚的乘务员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她瞥了一眼屋内的陈设，一切依然同她离开时一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>艾玛把你的行李放到了对应的座位上，别担心，“多瑙黎明号”从来没丢过东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>既然你执意留在这里……那就聊聊吧，调查员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>你先前提到上级、血食怪还有调查……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>为了确保大家的安全，我需要对所有登车乘客的身份进行一次普查登记。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>调查员转变策略，以更为直接的方式提出需求。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>……现在是战时，很多事情我们都会从简处理。突如其来的普查登记很容易让人产生不好的联想，进而引发骚乱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>我们都不愿意再见到白天车站发生的那一幕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>抱歉，我谨代表基金会前来与你进行交涉。严格来说，这是通知，而非交涉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>既然如此，那么麻烦出示一下允许采集乘客信息的官方同意书。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>如果任何人都可以自由上车，凭借一番演讲就能对我的列车进行搜查，那我的乘客们恐怕再也不需要睡觉了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她挑眉望着调查员，像是笃定她手上根本没有这种东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>……多亏了“高效”的政府，我连官方同意书的影子都没看到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>但既然您如此看重行政手续，那么按照规定，如果您坚持不配合的话，我将会行使身为基金会调查员的权利——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>调查员稍作停顿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>紧急截停“多瑙黎明号”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>紧急截停？！不……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>很遗憾。从程序上讲，截停列车是基于条约的一项标准操作，完全合乎规定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>我明白，但是……这样可能会给其他乘客造成不便……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>只是对“乘客”造成不便吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>——！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乘务员张开嘴，又立即闭上，下意识看向身旁的列车长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>列车长并不言语，只轻轻拍了拍她的肩膀，随后走上前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>我明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>我们接受你的提议，调查员。但有个条件——你的登记工作必须由乘务组亲自陪同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>当然可以，登记工作本就应该公开透明。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>在登记目的也公开透明的情况下，是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>别担心，列车长女士。我已对你们毫无保留——在职责允许的范围内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>调查员保持着一贯的官方微笑。她站起身，向眼前的“伙伴”伸手示好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>事不宜迟，现在就开始行动吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>合作愉快，列车长女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>告知乘客，解释情况，登记信息……“合作”调查有条不紊地继续着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>还有几节车厢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>嗯，除去驾驶室、守车和我们的休息室，再去掉这里和已经登记了的两节车厢的话……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>十二减三，再减二，再减一。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>还有六节车厢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>调查员微笑着给出答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-639201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-639201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-639201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西：</div><div>列车长，乘务员，我需要你们的帮忙……我的两个学生在车厢里走丢了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>衣着整洁、神情严肃的女士迈着稍快的步伐走来，额角已经微有汗珠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>请冷静，女士。您和学生走散多久了？他们的样貌有什么特征吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-639201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-639201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-639201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西：</div><div>大概这么高，一个怀里抱着玩偶，另一个留着很短的棕色卷发，喜欢四处跑动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-639201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-639201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-639201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西：</div><div>已经快要两刻钟了，就在餐车附近，他们趁着人多，把列车当成了游戏场……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>列车长……似乎是我们刚才见过的孩子们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>记录着样貌特征的乘务员小声提醒着列车长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>哦……野树莓的“跟班”们？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>女士，请您回过身看看，那是不是您的两位学生？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>跟随列车长的话音，众人的视线越过半节车厢，落在车厢尾部座位的几个孩子身上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>然后呢，在荣耀而强大的阿诺德五世伯爵之后，是我了不起的祖父萨瓦诺维奇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>萨瓦诺维奇祖父带我们去了多瑙河北边的埃杰什，修建了埃杰什磨坊……不对，是城堡！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>在埃杰什城堡，他活了一百六十五岁……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-618420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-618420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-618420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">孩童们：</div><div>呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她兴致勃勃地讲述着自己的荣耀往昔，却没注意身旁的听众已经合上双眼，几乎睡倒过去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-639201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-639201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-639201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西：</div><div>威廉！安娜贝尔！你们怎么可以没有经过我的同意就到处乱跑！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>严肃的家庭教师疾步走过去，一尘不染的裙摆扬起比平时要更大的幅度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-637411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-637411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-637411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安娜贝尔：</div><div>嗯……唔？啊……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-639101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-639101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-639101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小威廉：</div><div>多、多萝西女士！真要命……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>熟睡的孩童们一下惊醒，安娜贝尔也吓得从野树莓的膝上弹了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-639201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-639201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-639201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西：</div><div>安娜贝尔！你立刻、马上给我下来，你怎么可以和……和那样的人待在一起？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-639201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-639201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-639201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西：</div><div>还有你！威廉，赶紧给我过来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>那……那样的人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>是在说我吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从这位严肃女士来回扫射的眼神之中，野树莓终于注意到自己与新朋友在衣着上的差异。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一只手轻轻搭在女孩的肩膀上，打断了她的思考。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>方便做个信息登记吗？这位小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>我如果说我不方便，你们会放我离开吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-639201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-639201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-639201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西：</div><div>列车长，我建议您好好盘查一下这个人的身份，她很有可能拐带了我的学生们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安娜贝尔：</div><div>不……多萝西女士，是我迷路了……还是野树莓姐姐帮了我！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-639201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-639201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-639201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西：</div><div>安娜贝尔，临行前我告诉你多少遍了，在外要时刻注意身份，不管是自己的，还是别人的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>身份……？喂，女士，请把话说清楚……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>很抱歉，这位女士。这只是一次临时的乘客信息登记，并非针对野树莓小姐个人的盘查……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>别担心，我来为您登记……野树莓小姐，您的身份是？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>我是野树莓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她挺直腰杆，理直气壮地如此答道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>不、不是这样的……野树莓小姐。我的意思是……您需要登记一下种族信息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>种族。噢，没问题！我……我是瑟尔玛尼奇人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>不是名字，不是出身地，也不是性别。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>“神秘学家”还是“人类”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>哦！那我大概，应该是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>没有第三种选项。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>你怎么知道……好吧！我，我是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩面露难色，眼神躲闪，可一旁的小孩子却替她开了口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-639101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-639101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-639101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小威廉：</div><div>她是我们的血食怪老大，当然是神秘学家！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-639201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-639201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-639201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西：</div><div>住口！威廉！谁教你这么说话的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>……咦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯&amp;告死鸟：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>哈哈，我刚才和孩子们开玩笑瞎编的，这可作不得数！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>难、难道你们小时候没玩过过家家游戏吗？我不仅扮演过血食怪，还扮演过狼人、鲁萨尔卡……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>我从没有过这种经历。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>列车长异常冷淡地打断女孩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>现在是非常时期，以后别在列车上开这种玩笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>我发誓，我以后再也不敢了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>野树莓呼出的一口气还悬在半空中，一旁刚刚从睡梦中清醒，对眼前的情境感到十分困惑的女孩却开了口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安娜贝尔：</div><div>可是姐姐，你确实是血食怪呀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>空气变得安静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安娜贝尔：</div><div>你还用影子向我们证明了……你说，真正的血食怪是没有影子的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安娜贝尔：</div><div>血食怪都很厉害，很强大，而且姐姐是善良的血食怪，我觉得……我觉得你们都应该尊重她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她鼓起勇气，顶着家庭教师愈发可怕的神情，声音小且坚定地为众人的态度提出了质疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人们齐刷刷低头望向女孩脚下，那里的地毯上刺绣着精美的花卉与几何图样，却不见一丝阴影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>呀，真的没有影子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>呃……糟了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>这就是你所谓的……“玩笑”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>列车长上前一步，高大的身影吓得孩童们连连后退。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的手再次搭上女孩的肩膀，兼具礼仪与力量，不让女孩有任何逃离的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>很遗憾，接下来你需要跟我们走一趟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>——根据“多瑙黎明号”列车安全手册，我将依照规章制度，对你进行封闭审讯。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TMW-05"}}